I reach the beverage section in the supermarket.
There is a big shelf there.
There are many boxes of tea powder on the shelf.
I look at the different types of boxes.
I like Indian tea very much.
I want a good tea powder.
I look at each box.
There is ginger tea there.
There is cardamom tea there too.
I like cardamom tea very much.
Therefore, I want that.
I take a box of cardamom tea.
I put that box in my cart.
Now there is tea powder in my cart too.
